#. module: gdpr_inventory
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gdpr_inventory.field_gdpr_inventory__restrict_domain_code
msgid ""
"Python code that will be executed before domain evaluation. Any variables defined here will be available during domain evaluation.\n"
"\n"
"Available variables:\n"
"* env: Odoo environment.\n"
"* time: time python module.\n"
"* datetime: datetime python module.\n"
"* dateutil: dateutil python module.\n"
"* timezone: pytz.timezone python module."
msgstr ""
"Python-kod som kommer att köras före domänutvärderingen. Alla variabler som definieras här kommer att vara tillgängliga under "
"domänutvärderingen.\n"
"\n"
"Tillgängliga variabler:\n"
"* env: Odoo-miljö.\n"
"* time: tid python-modul.\n"
"* datetime: datetime python-modul.\n"
"* dateutil: python-modulen dateutil.\n"
"* timezone: pytz.timezone python-modul."

#. module: gdpr_inventory
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gdpr_inventory.field_gdpr_inventory__inventory_domain_code
msgid ""
"Python code that will be executed before domain evaluation. Any variables defined here will be available during domain evaluation.\n"
"\n"
"Available variables:\n"
"* env: Odoo environment.\n"
"* time: time python module.\n"
"* datetime: datetime python module.\n"
"* dateutil: dateutil python module.\n"
"* timezone: pytz.timezone python module.\n"
"* restrict_days: Restrict time of this inventory"
msgstr ""
"Python-kod som kommer att köras före domänutvärderingen. Alla variabler som definieras här kommer att vara tillgängliga under "
"domänutvärderingen.\n"
"\n"
"Tillgängliga variabler:\n"
"* env: Odoo-miljö.\n"
"* time: tid python-modul.\n"
"* datetime: datetime python-modul.\n"
"* dateutil: python-modulen dateutil.\n"
"* timezone: pytz.timezone python-modul.\n"
"* restrict_days: Begränsa tiden för denna inventering"

#. module: gdpr_inventory
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gdpr_inventory.field_gdpr_inventory__restrict_code
msgid ""
"Python code to run when restricting records.\n"
"\n"
"Available variables:\n"
"* env: Odoo environment.\n"
"* time: time python module.\n"
"* datetime: datetime python module.\n"
"* dateutil: dateutil python module.\n"
"* timezone: pytz.timezone python module.\n"
"* inventory: This inventory record.\n"
"* objects: The gdpr objects to be restricted (gdpr.object). Actual records to be processed can be accessed through objects.mapped('object_id')."
msgstr ""
"Python-kod att köra vid begränsning av poster.\n"
"\n"
"Tillgängliga variabler:\n"
"* env: Odoo-miljö.\n"
"* time: tid python-modul.\n"
"* datetime: datetime python-modul.\n"
"* dateutil: python-modulen dateutil.\n"
"* timezone: pytz.timezone python-modul.\n"
"* inventory: Denna inventeringspost.\n"
"* objects (objekt): De gdpr-objekt som ska begränsas (gdpr.object). Faktiska poster som ska bearbetas kan nås via objects.mapped('object_id')."

